{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06595","headline":"观范阳递俘 · 储光羲","name":"观范阳递俘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北河旄星陨，鬼方猕林胡。\n羣师舞弓矢，电发归燕墟。\n皇皇轩辕君，赞赞臯陶谟。\n方思壮军实，远近递生俘。\n车马践大逵，合沓成深渠。\n牧人过橐駞，校正引騊駼。\n烈风朝送寒，云雪霭天隅。\n草木同一色，谁能辨荣枯。\n四履封元戎，百金酬勇夫。\n大邦武功爵，固与炎皇殊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}